AB  - The article discusses the features of psychological and pedagogical support of the formation of professional competencies that ensure the competitiveness of future telecommunications specialists. Stages and content of the program of psychological and pedagogical support for the preparation of bachelors in "Infocommunication Technologies and Communication Systems" specialty direction were studied. The system of integrated assessment of future professional competencies is presented. A modern psychological and pedagogical technique for the formation of professional competencies of future specialists on the basis of trainings is proposed.
